<title>CANADA: IPL says no flow disruption on oil line.</title>
<headline>IPL says no flow disruption on oil line.</headline>
<dateline>CALGARY 1997-01-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>IPL Energy Inc said on Friday that it experienced minor rate loss on one of its pipelines but no major disruptions on its crude oil and products system to the U.S. Midwest from Alberta.</p>
</text>
